# Run make keys and paste the store key below.
@base = http://localhost:8080
@key = paste-store-42-key
@store = 42
@other_store = 43

### FR-1: number of orders in the last 7 days
GET {{base}}/tenants/{{store}}/orders/count?range=last_7d
Authorization: Bearer {{key}}

### FR-1: orders and total sales in the last 7 days
GET {{base}}/tenants/{{store}}/orders/summary?range=last_7d
Authorization: Bearer {{key}}

### FR-7: the PRD's example, with from and to
GET {{base}}/tenants/{{store}}/orders/count?from=2026-10-01&to=2026-10-08
Authorization: Bearer {{key}}

### Arbitrary timestamps
GET {{base}}/tenants/{{store}}/orders/count?from=2026-10-01T11:22:33&to=2026-10-08T09:08:07
Authorization: Bearer {{key}}

### FR-2: orders per day for the last 30 days
GET {{base}}/tenants/{{store}}/orders/trend?interval=day&range=last_30d
Authorization: Bearer {{key}}

### FR-3: top 10 products by sales this week
GET {{base}}/tenants/{{store}}/products/top?n=10&by=sales&range=this_week
Authorization: Bearer {{key}}

### FR-4: orders by status
GET {{base}}/tenants/{{store}}/orders/breakdown?by=status&range=last_7d
Authorization: Bearer {{key}}

### FR-4: orders by category
GET {{base}}/tenants/{{store}}/orders/breakdown?by=category&range=last_30d
Authorization: Bearer {{key}}

### FR-5: this key on another store returns 404
GET {{base}}/tenants/{{other_store}}/orders/count?range=last_7d
Authorization: Bearer {{key}}

### What can be asked
GET {{base}}/tenants/{{store}}/meta
Authorization: Bearer {{key}}

### Check against main database
POST {{base}}/tenants/{{store}}/verify
Authorization: Bearer {{key}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"endpoint": "orders/count", "params": {"range": "last_7d"}}

